 ['Finite thermal timing / retention window','DERIVED conditional uniform error &lt;127/2²³&lt;2⁻¹⁶ for16±2⁻¹¹ model time units. Eightfold wider than the response-jet window; relative halfwidth2⁻¹⁵; post-deadline hold2⁻¹¹.','Certify propagation of the derivative-launch and curvature-launch vectors. Permanent retention and device-time calibration remain OPEN.'],
